  "finding": {
    "priority": "P1",
    "description": "A prior native receipt could pass in a fresh run, including with zero dispatch allowance."
  },
  "fixes": [
    "Runner-owned current run, Git revision, source-content hash and unique invocation ID are mandatory verifier inputs.",
    "Native readbacks must match the current invocation dispatch records consumed from the skill budget.",
    "Zero allowance and expired deadline are checked by the runner before invoking any injected application adapter.",
    "Rewritten receipt context, missing/partial/tampered dispatch records and unwitnessed proposals cannot establish canonical delivery.",
    "Hosted contract bindings must also match independently loaded receipt-root source identities.",
    "Partial native execution keeps its consumed dispatches; failed/unavailable paths clear delivery claims."
  ],
